      "message": "\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5460865451586250451\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09FA9B5.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e🩵\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e Telegram now has a \u003cb\u003eRich Text Editor\u003c/b\u003e.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eIt supports tables, headings, inline media, lists, AI content, formulas, and more.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5357135183864667855\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9888.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e😈\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e Messaging apps will never be the same!",
